1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,019
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Sally and her mom went shopping.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,680
They are looking for a chair.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,480
The mom sees a nice brown stool.

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,860
It is of good quality.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,060
It will last forever.

6
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:17,540
Sally thinks it is ugly though.

7
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,060
She sees a pink plastic chair.

8
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,140
She points at it.

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,960
Mom, let's get that one.

10
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,580
Her mom says no.

11
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:31,580
Sally throws a fit.

12
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:35,020
She knows she can get what she wants

13
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,540
if she cries.

14
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,820
She starts crying loudly.

15
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,200
Other shoppers stare at Sally.

16
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,840
Her mom gets embarrassed.

17
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,520
She ends up buying the pink chair.

18
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:53,180
At home, Sally sits on it.

19
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,240
It quickly breaks.

20
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:58,040
Sally is on the floor.

21
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:01,120
She cries from the pain.
